    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Surreal Horror Game Inspired By Reoccurring Dreams.</h2><br>Lost Surreal Hell is a Turn Based RPG, where you collect elements, and evolve your attacks, BUT if you wander too far off the path, you may end up stuck in a strange surreal hell full of aesthetic clashing, disjointed worlds full of surreal comedy shows, brainwashing, a strange company running a dying MMO in the backrooms and a dark truth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game world left to rot.</h2><br>Follow the journey of the main character as they &quot;mysteriously appear&quot; in a colourful, dream-like world. <br>It is clear that there is something wrong with this world however, only you can unravel the truth.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306400/extras/82808dbdc05e9ba7b32a2ffce484f53e.avif?t=1730550047\" /></span><br><br>Combat can take a while to learn and has difficult survival horror resource management elements to it.<br><br>Every fight in this game is winnable, no matter how impossible some of them may seem.<br><br>There are no luck based misses in this game, if the opponent wants to dodge a bullet, they must have a higher speed stat than the speed of sound, otherwise it will hit them 100% of the time.<br><br>Each element has it's own evolution tree, attack evolutions can be purchased from the evolution menu, and you can only equip 6 attacks at a time from your list allowing for many different options and playing styles.",
